    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/luqmanfadlli/NuvioMobile-Enhanced/tarball/1.1.0-beta.3",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/luqmanfadlli/NuvioMobile-Enhanced/zipball/1.1.0-beta.3",
    "body": "## 1.1.0-beta.3 release notes\r\n\r\n### Nuvio Enhanced\r\n\r\n- 0216de6a9 fix(player): sample the video less often and drop sudden dark frames for control glass (#424) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 2aa26e811 fix(player): skip video frame glass for HDR video on Android (#424) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 0e4db4b73 fix(collections): play .gifv artwork as GIF and fall back to the static cover when it fails (#414) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 3f9c50c12 fix(streams): look up the title logo when playback starts without one @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 375d93d90 fix(home): replace startup hero items that do not come from the chosen hero sources (#394) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- f326d11ec fix(home): pick default hero sources from the catalog order until the user chooses (#394) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- b23b28a87 feat(player): move skip, next episode, and recommendation card on the right above the end time (#417) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- ff72092e5 fix(streams): stop smart sheet scrolling while the sheet is closing (#419) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- e5000dc8c fix(ios): stop libass from loading the 16 MB CJK font into memory on every subtitle switch @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- d251935ad feat(playback): let users choose when a title counts as watched (#420) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- ee8dc64fc feat(downloads): add a legacy iOS download mode that writes straight to the folder (#411) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 043ece0bd fix(downloads): show a single percent sign in download progress @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 8106d9fe1 fix(ui): shrink long screen titles to fit beside header actions @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 2d3dcc642 fix(ios): keep downloads settings in the tab that opened them @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- [Smart Streams: size Auto to the screen, count untagged releases as English, live connection (#418)](https://github.com/luqmanfadlli/NuvioMobile-Enhanced/pull/418) @lalith14  \r\n- [Pin home rows and hidden rows section (#410)](https://github.com/luqmanfadlli/NuvioMobile-Enhanced/pull/410) @Sam3110xavier  \r\n- 49f73c2fa fix(ios): align the tablet detail mute button with the navigation bar @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- 875de58db fix(ios): export settings through the share sheet (#389) @luqmanfadlli  \r\n- c598b0c14 fix(player): keep hero trailers off while a mini player or parked PiP play @luqmanfadlli  \r\n\r\n### Upstream (NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile)\r\n\r\n- [fix(ui): prevent Arabic title wrapping in the details hero (#2735)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2735) @i7xre  \r\n- c5a73772f fix(android): mark wifi as optional @tapframe  \r\n- c31c30e1e fix(player): ignore gesture insets for bottom controls on android @skoruppa  \r\n- 4baf886ee fix(ios): keep downloads out of iCloud and computer backups @claude  \r\n- f81edc653 fix(debrid): match TorBox alternative-hash cache answers @WhiteGiso  \r\n- 103c5e07a fix(trakt): prevent unbounded library refresh queue @enricopro  \r\n- [Update Hungarian translations- #2341 (#2689)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2689) @emgeje  \r\n- [i18n(he): add values-iw so the Hebrew translation loads on Android (#2720)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2720) @Yosi-Brown  \r\n- [feat(player): show addon's subtitle label in the subtitle list (#2714)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2714) @skoruppa  \r\n- [i18n: add missing French strings for downloads, servers and tracking (#2687)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2687) @SK-Gits  \r\n- [Translation improvements and adjustments for Slovak language (#2707)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2707) @mmsw91  \r\n- [feat(i18n): sync Turkish localization with latest additions (#2706)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2706) @stuntsnakee  \r\n- [fix(servers): keep Jellyfin and Emby sign-ins separate per profile (#2705)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2705) @skoruppa  \r\n- [Update strings to Title Case for consistency with Discovery Page (#2696)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2696) @ZXXII  \r\n- [i18n(es): fix mistranslated brand names and terminology, translate missing strings (#2033)](https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/pull/2033) @Mangel-CC  ",
